<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce nine-month net rises 51 percent.</title>
<headline>Oce nine-month net rises 51 percent.</headline>
<text>
<p>First nine months to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.93 vs   4.37</p>
<p>    Net profit			   107.5 vs   71.3</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   2.91 vs   2.09</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   212.7  vs 151.9</p>
<p>    Leasing income			91.7  vs  82.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    78.5  vs  65.7</p>
<p>    Tax				     26.9  vs  15.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
